Now my daughter, he said, "I want to tell you of another excess of my love.

904
01:09:15.520 --> 01:09:22.440
One who does my will and lives in it," now living in it means 24, 7, 3, 6, 5, not doing

905
01:09:22.440 --> 01:09:25.920
an act every now and then.

906
01:09:25.920 --> 01:09:33.000
One who does my will and lives in it comes to embrace the works of my humanity.

907
01:09:33.000 --> 01:09:43.880
So that has to be John, John, oh gosh, I've just forgotten it now, 14, 7 or something like

908
01:09:43.880 --> 01:09:49.760
that, they will do the same works as I do when I go to the Father, okay?

909
01:09:49.760 --> 01:09:56.680
Verse 7 doesn't sound right, might be verse 12.

910
01:09:56.680 --> 01:10:02.800
So one who does my will and lives in it comes to embrace the works of my humanity, because

911
01:10:02.800 --> 01:10:07.560
I greatly yearn that the creature become similar to me.

912
01:10:07.560 --> 01:10:13.160
That's Romans 8, 29, he wants to transform us into him.

913
01:10:13.160 --> 01:10:22.360
And since my will and the souls are one, my will takes pleasure in her and enjoying itself,

914
01:10:22.360 --> 01:10:26.240
it places all the good that I contain into the soul.

915
01:10:26.240 --> 01:10:35.240
And I form in her the deposit of my very sacramental hosts, making us living hosts, okay?

916
01:10:35.240 --> 01:10:43.960
My will which she contains lends her and surrounds her with divine decorum, homage and honor.

917
01:10:43.960 --> 01:10:49.840
And I entrust everything to her because I am certain to keep my works in a safe place,

918
01:10:49.840 --> 01:10:53.640
that's because she's living in the divine will.

919
01:10:53.640 --> 01:10:59.240
And since my will becomes the actor, spectator and custodian of all my goods, of my works

920
01:10:59.240 --> 01:11:04.800
and of my very life, that needs a good deal of thinking about.

921
01:11:04.800 --> 01:11:08.800
going to stop there because the next message is long and I don't want it to start it.
